OL,3,GNEWSAFailed City of Culture bid has
OL,4,A'raised aspiration'
OL,5,
OL,6,FIpswich is out of the running to become
OL,7,FUK City of Culture 2029 after failing
OL,8,Fto make the shortlist, but the town's
OL,9,FMP says he remains proud of it
OL,10,Fregardless.
OL,12,FSuffolk's county town was one of nine
OL,13,Flocations to make the longlist of
OL,14,Fcandidates - each receiving #60,000 to
OL,15,Fhelp develop their bids.
OL,17,FBlackpool, Milton Keynes, Sheffield and
OL,18,FWrexham have made the shortlist and are
OL,19,Fin contention for #10m of investment
OL,20,Ffrom the government with the winner
OL,21,Fannounced in early 2027.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,380,370,200,160,0,100
