OL,3,GNEWSAFailed City of Culture bid has
OL,4,A'raised aspiration'
OL,5,
OL,6,FJack Abbott MP said: "This isn't the
OL,7,Fresult we were hoping for, but I am so
OL,8,Fproud of our town. This bid has changed
OL,9,Fhow Ipswich sees itself and the
OL,10,Faspiration, ideas and the confidence it
OL,11,Fhas built are here to stay."
